<title>BELGIUM: W.Europe new car registrations doyr-yr Nov.</title>
<headline>W.Europe new car registrations doyr-yr Nov.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>West European new car registrations rose 6.4 percent year-on-year in November, the Association of European Car manufacturers (ACEA) said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>ACEA said 903,300 new cars were registered for all brands of car sold in the European Union, Norway, Switzerland and Liechtenstein during November this year.</p>
</text>
